  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Peace and Stability in Abyei Permanent Court of Arbitration (PCA) Box: Decreasing Tensions Between Communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project contributes to enabling an environment for improved peace and stability by reviving and strengthening traditional inter-tribal relations in Sudan. In support of the on-going peace process in Abyei, an adaptive and flexible community-based approach has been designed for the implementation of the project as the communities are directly responsible for the identification, selection and monitoring of interventions and activities in an effort to foster reconciliation and transform inter-tribal dynamics and attitudes towards stable and peaceful coexistence.</narrative>
  </description>
